-- Segment embeddings (#895, ADR 0051 §Vectors): judgment_segment gains embedding_model (the model version that produced the vector, nullable until embedded), a per-partition HNSW index on embedding (halfvec_cosine_ops, m=16, ef_construction=64; created on the partitions here because indexes on a partitioned parent cannot be built concurrently, and filled by the corpus.embed job), and the app role may UPDATE only the two embedding columns. Additive only.
